program	errors/forwarding_capture_escaping.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	cannot capture non-escaping closure `f` in an escaping closure
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: cannot capture non-escaping closure `f` in an escaping closure"
log	"  --> examples/errors/forwarding_capture_escaping.saw:8:5"
log	"    |"
log	" 8 |     { x: Int in f(x) }"
log	"    |     ^"
log	"   hint: an escaping closure outlives the frame; only call a non-escaping closure or forward it as a non-escaping argument"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
